Description: Linux kernel image 7.0.0 for the cv181x-sodoport flavour
 Builds an upstream Linux kernel image package for the Milk-V Duo 256M using
 the cv181x-sodoport flavour name. The package installs the versioned kernel
 image under /boot, board device trees under /usr/lib/linux-image-<version>/,
 and kernel modules under /lib/modules/<version>.

Package: linux-image-cv181x-sodoport
Architecture: riscv64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 linux-image-7.0.0-cv181x-sodoport (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Meta-package for the cv181x-sodoport kernel
 Depends on the current versioned cv181x-sodoport kernel package so systems
 can track the latest packaged kernel through normal Debian upgrades.

Package: linux-source-cv181x-sodoport
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Patched Linux source bundle for the cv181x-sodoport flavour
 Installs a compressed, patched Linux source tree for the cv181x-sodoport
 flavour under /usr/src so the packaged kernel can be inspected or rebuilt.
